# Playwright e2e

## Commands

- `npm run test:e2e:install` — install Chromium browsers
- `npm run test:e2e` — full e2e suite
- `npm run test:e2e:desktop` — desktop download smoke only

## Base URL

Override with `PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL`. Prefer:

1. Local during development: `http://localhost:3000`
2. Current Vercel production when verifying deploy: `https://asbatechs-crm-web.vercel.app`

Avoid assuming custom DNS hosts are on the latest commit unless Domains mapping is verified.

## Spec rules

- Prefer `getByRole` / `getByTestId` over fragile CSS.
- Desktop download CTA: `data-testid="desktop-download-btn"`.
- Do not assert on secrets or env-only content.
- Skip gracefully if a route is 404 (not yet deployed) only for optional API routes; core download page should not show “Installer URL is not configured”.

## After changes

When editing `/download/desktop`, desktop installer URL helpers, middleware download HTML, or `/api/desktop/installer`, run `npm run test:e2e:desktop` against local and/or production base URL before merge.
